<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="A.R.I.A." data-copy-zh="A.R.I.A.">A.R.I.A.</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Meet A.R.I.A. after the floor 45 encounter, follow three home conversations, and unlock crafted-gift upgrades." data-copy-zh="完成第45层遭遇后结识A.R.I.A.，推进三段日常交心及手工礼物升级。">Meet A.R.I.A. after the floor 45 encounter, follow three home conversations, and unlock crafted-gift upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_and_Recruiting_A.R.I.A."></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Seven-Round_Battle_Guidance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Calibration"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="First_Garden"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_A.R.I.A."></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Garden_Walk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Sirena_Isle_Encounters"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: A.R.I.A. — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aria.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="A.R.I.A. — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aria.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>A.R.I.A. — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>A.R.I.A.’s relationship route begins after her normal Dungeon floor 45 encounter. Her home conversations, optional garden date and crafted gifts are separate from the encounter itself.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Once she joins, visit Calibration Room daily 11:00–18:00. If the Courtyard is built, her morning portrait is in Garden08:00–11:00. She can also be away on an arranged resort vacation.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Route_Walkthrough"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Complete the three home conversations in order: Calibration at Known 25 in the calibration room → First Garden at Friend 100 in the morning garden → Closer at Close Friend 200 back in the calibration room.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Calibration</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Calibration Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 15 Energy; 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First Garden</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Garden; Friend (100); after Calibration</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Closer</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Calibration Room; Close Friend (200); after First Garden</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Garden Walk is a separate Friend 100 outing, started from the calibration room 11:00–16:00 after the Courtyard is built. It does not replace the morning-garden heart-to-heart.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Special-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Garden / Calibration Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Garden Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Calibration Room; Friend (100); Courtyard built; 11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Crafted-gift scene</th><th scope="col">Where / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Training upgraded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">What the Locks Could Not Own</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Calibration Room; 11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Calibration</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Void-Kissed Charm</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Doggie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Pulse She Authored</th><td data-label="Where / start window">Calibration Room; 11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); home from vacation; Closer</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; hand in 1 Golden Pulse Bracelet</td><td data-label="Training upgraded">Oral</td></tr></tbody></table><p>At In Love 3000 and home from vacation, the two crafted gifts below permanently upgrade the named training types. Each consumes one gift, takes 0 min and completes once. Each finished gift upgrade adds 50% to her income multiplier; its own training experience is doubled. Crafting recipes belong in the Forge guide.</p><p>At the resort she has Talk, buffet, beach relaxation, private beach time, spa and a repeatable sunset-walk conversation. The sunset walk starts at the beach 17:00–20:00,60 min, once/day; see the resort guide for booking and rotation.</p><p>Favorite stats are Technology, Intelligence, Perception. Learning AI Programming improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If the floor 45 encounter is blocked, finish the preceding machine encounter on that run first.</li><li>The first garden conversation is 08:00–11:00; the separate Garden Walk date starts later from the calibration room.</li><li>A crafted-gift action needs the exact gift in your consumables, the relevant earlier conversation and her presence at home.</li><li>If the upstairs entrance is missing, Vixen or Vespa must be active staff to open that floor. A.R.I.A.’s recruitment opens her calibration room but does not itself open the upstairs corridor.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon encounters</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Staff and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_and_Recruiting_A.R.I.A."></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Seven-Round_Battle_Guidance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Calibration"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-First_Garden"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_A.R.I.A."></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Garden_Walk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Sirena_Isle_Encounters"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：A.R.I.A. 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aria.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="A.R.I.A. 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aria.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>A.R.I.A. 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>A.R.I.A.的关系路线在普通地下城第45层遭遇后开放。日常交心、可选花园约会与手工礼物升级，都与这场遭遇分开。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>加入后，每天11:00–18:00在校准室。建好庭院后，她08:00–11:00会出现在花园。安排度假时，她可能暂时离开青楼。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Route_Walkthrough"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>三段日常交心依次为：已知25在校准室进行校准→朋友100在清晨花园进行第一座花园→亲密朋友200回到校准室进行更近一步。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">校准</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">校准室；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；15精力；5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一座花园（菜单：初次庭园）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">花园；朋友（100好感）；完成：校准</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更近一步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">校准室；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：第一座花园</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>庭园漫步是独立出游，要求朋友100、庭院已建成，从11:00–16:00的校准室开始；不能替代清晨花园的交心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Special-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">花园 / 校准室；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庭园漫步</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">校准室；朋友（100好感）；已建造庭院；11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">手工礼物事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">升级训练</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">枷锁无法占有之物</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">校准室；11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；校准</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付虚吻护符×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">后入式</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她亲自书写的脉搏</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">校准室；11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000好感）；已结束度假；更近一步</td><td data-label="消耗">0分钟；交付金脉手镯×1</td><td data-label="升级训练">口交</td></tr></tbody></table><p>达到恋爱中3000、结束度假后，可用下表两件手工礼物永久升级指定训练。每项交付一件礼物，0分钟，仅一次；每完成一项，收入倍率增加50%，对应训练获得双倍经验。配方见锻造指南。</p><p>度假时可交谈、用餐、海滩休息、享受私密时光、水疗及重复进行日落散步。散步在海滩17:00–20:00开始，60分钟，每天一次；预约和轮换规则见度假指南。</p><p>偏好的属性为科技、智力、感知。学会AI编程可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>第45层遭遇受阻时，先完成本轮前面的机械遭遇。</li><li>首次花园交心在08:00–11:00；独立花园约会则要稍晚从校准室开始。</li><li>手工礼物行动需要消耗品栏中有指定礼物、相应交心已完成，且她人在青楼。</li><li>上层入口不出现时，需Vixen或Vespa处于在职状态以开放该楼层。A.R.I.A.加入后会开放校准室入口，但不会单独开放通往上层的走廊。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城遭遇</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">员工与训练</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">手工礼物</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假活动</a></li></ul></section>
